./docs/missions/lavd-docs-services-audit.log:4894:docs/missions/lavd-docs-services-audit.log:2585:./scheds/rust/scx_cake/README.md:7:> **ABSTRACT**: `scx_cake` is an experimental BPF CPU scheduler that adapts the network [CAKE](https://www.bufferbloat.net/projects/codel/wiki/Cake/) algorithm's DRR++ (Deficit Round Robin++) for CPU scheduling. Designed for **gaming workloads** on modern AMD and Intel hardware.
